# Day 31 – AI Supply Chain Control Tower

## 📌 Project Overview

The **AI Supply Chain Control Tower** is an interactive web application that simulates the responsibilities of a Head of Operations managing a global supply chain. The application presents real-time operational disruptions, requiring users to prioritize incidents, make strategic decisions, and maintain business performance under pressure.

Built entirely using **HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript**, the project runs completely offline inside a single HTML file.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

* Understand Supply Chain Control Tower operations.
* Practice operational decision-making under time constraints.
* Learn how business KPIs are affected by supply chain disruptions.
* Experience enterprise dashboard design and simulation.

---

## 🚀 Features

* Live operational alert simulation.
* Dynamic KPI dashboard.
* Multiple alert priorities (Critical, High, Medium, Low).
* Decision-based gameplay with different outcomes.
* Real-time score tracking.
* Countdown timer.
* Event activity log.
* Performance grading system.
* Responsive dashboard layout.
* Pause functionality.
* Help & Instructions modal.
* Replay simulation option.
* Modern dark-themed enterprise UI.

